==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|nl}} ''[[Noorsch]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-Norse.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{rhymes|ɔː(r)s}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Of, or relating to the [[people]], [[language]] and [[culture]] of ancient [[Scandinavia]].
# Of, or relating to the [[North Germanic]] group of [[language]]s.

